DATA;
/* Level 0 holds a 0.2 m wall along x (y 0 to 0.2, 3 m high) with four gaps, and doors that the model hosts in no wall (no opening, */
/* no IfcRelFillsElement), each a box: */
/* Gap 1, x 0 to 1.26, a lift door as six IfcDoors named 'liftdeur' of one IfcDoorType (OperationType NOTDEFINED), none stating */
/* OverallWidth or OverallHeight and none a part of another: the leaf set 1.54 m wide in the shaft (x -0.14 to 1.4, y 0.205 to 0.435, */
/* 2.3 m high), two 0.5 m panels inside it (2.1 m), two 0.25 m jamb posts in the gap (2.425 m) and a 0.15 m profile. */
/* Gap 2, x 3 to 4.6: a double door as two 0.8 m leaves, Leaf 1 and Leaf 2, side by side. */
/* Gap 3, x 6 to 7: Door S (1.0 m, stating OverallWidth and OverallHeight) and Frame S round it (1.08 m, stating neither). */
/* Gap 4, x 9 to 10: Door P (1.0 m) and Lining P (1.1 m), which IfcRelAggregates makes a part of Door P. */
